    defaultPrim = "World"
    doc = """o7 single-hand grasp smoke test.

HOW TO TEST (do NOT drag the hand TF during Play):
1. Stop. Pose bottle in the palm / between fingers.
2. Set finger drive targetPosition near upper limits (wrap). Soft/Inspire-like
   K needs ~20–40° of blocked error to build normal force → friction.
3. Play. Fingers close onto the bottle via drives (mimic follows).
4. Friction check: select the BOTTLE and drag it / apply force — it should
   resist. Or keep hand fixed (root FixedJoint) and pull bottle out.
5. Dragging LinkerHand_o7 translate arrows teleports the articulation against
   contacts → looks oily / squeezes objects out even with good μ. That is not
   a valid grasp test.

Objects must have PhysicsMaterialAPI (bottle/apple below). Hand colliders use
frictionCombineMode=max.
"""
    endTimeCode = 1000000
    metersPerUnit = 1
    startTimeCode = 0
    timeCodesPerSecond = 60
    upAxis = "Z"
)

